OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFrom the Central Belt
OL,6,Fsouthwards a fine dry day with bright
OL,7,Fand sunny spells and light winds.
OL,8,FCloudy across Argyll with a few light
OL,9,Fshowers appearing.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy skies feeding up the
OL,12,FCentral Belt, perhaps bringing drizzly
OL,13,Fshowers by dawn. Elsewhere dry with
OL,14,Fclear spells bringing the risk of
OL,15,Frural frost and fog patches come dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
