OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCentral Belt mainly cloudy
OL,6,Fwith the odd light drizzly shower.
OL,7,FElsewhere dry with bright and sunny
OL,8,Fspells best across Argyll and
OL,9,FAyrshire. Winds light mainly from the
OL,10,Feast.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FCentral Belt mainly cloudy with a few
OL,14,Flight showers, Elsewhere dry with
OL,15,Fbrighter spells. Winds light. Early
OL,16,Ffrost and possibily fog patches in
OL,17,Fwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
